<html lang='ko'>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: monospace; margin: 40px; line-height: 1.5; background:
            #f4f4f4; } .container { margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 20px;
                           border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.1); } .header {
                                                                                           color: #2bb03d; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 2px
            solid #1d973c; padding-bottom: 10px; } .section { margin-bottom: 20px;
                                                       padding: 15px; background: #f8f8f8; border-left: 4px solid #486853; }
    </style>
    <title></title>
</head>
<body>
<div class='container'>
    <div class='header'>
        New Rental Created:
        {{meta.goods.name}} by {{meta.user.nameKr}}
    </div>

    <div class='section'>
        <strong>Rental Details:</strong>
        <br />
        1. 대여 일시 : {{meta.rentalFrom}}<br />
        2. 대여 종료 : {{meta.rentalTo}}<br />
        3. 대여 물품 : {{meta.goods.name}}<br />
        4. 대여 수량 : {{meta.rentalQuantity}}<br />
        5. 대여자 : {{meta.user.nameKr}} / {{meta.user.nameEn}}<br />
        6. 연락처 : {{meta.user.email}}
    </div>


</div>
</body>
</html>